      "title": "Aurora Bet: KYC for online gambling",
      "summary": "Aurora Bet is a fictional sportsbook and casino. The licence still needs a named adult on the account before the first deposit. An over-18 gate (wine, cigarettes) is not enough here. The operator also needs to know who the player is and from which member state.\r\n\r\nThat check is where live operators lose signups. Aurora Bet is the full front door: live tables, jackpots, create-account, lobby. The player confirms in Authbound Wallet. The floor opens, the welcome bonus lands, and verified withdrawals unlock.\r\n\r\nAuthbound Wallet is the holder. Requested claims: given_name, family_name, nationality, age_over_18.",
